	(text "All switches are Omron DF2F-5L3 SPDT switches, with only the NC or NO lead connected.\n\nScheme does not show: Efuse, Battery Protection ICs controlling discharge and charge,\nfuel gague with cell balancing, or microcontroller interface to CAN bus.\n\nSee detailed schematic for more information."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 47.244 186.182 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
